                <tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>200</code></td><td>Success — returns the resource or a list.</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>201</code></td><td>Created — returns the new resource.</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>202</code></td><td>Accepted — the request has been queued for async processing.</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>204</code></td><td>No Content — successful delete, empty body.</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>401</code></td><td>Unauthorized — token missing or invalid.</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>403</code></td><td>Forbidden — token valid but not permitted on this endpoint, or request originates from a disallowed IP address.</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>404</code></td><td>Not Found — resource ID does not exist.</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>422</code></td><td>Unprocessable Entity — validation error; body contains <code>{"error": "…"}</code>.</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
