            <p class="text-muted small mb-1">DNS records within a domain. Records can be standalone (with an explicit <code>value</code>), linked to a network interface, or linked to a virtual IP. For interface- or VIP-linked A/AAAA records the value is derived automatically from the live IP.</p>
